<title>LATVIA: LATVIAN DEPOSITORY REGISTERS POLIGRAFISTS SHARES.</title>
<headline>LATVIAN DEPOSITORY REGISTERS POLIGRAFISTS SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central depository said on Thursday that it has registered the share issue of the Poligrafists company.</p>
<p>The depository said in a statement that it registered 370,260 Poligrafist shares with a one lat nominal price.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
